[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0020","text":"树里，怎么了？突然停下脚步\n累了的话我帮你拿行李吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0030","text":"不，不是累了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0040","text":"一想到今天是最后一次看这里了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0050","text":"有点舍不得啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0060","text":"明明才待了几天\n却感觉像是成了这里的学生一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0070","text":"说明这是一次很充实的集训啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0080","text":"啊啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0089","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0090","text":"还想再来这里啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0100","text":"是啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0110","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0120","text":"好了，得赶紧收拾才行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0130","text":"全部结束才算集训结束\n这种事也不能马虎！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01110000_04_0140","text":"走吧，制作人！"}]
